WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.000
NEXUS: HELIX never sleeps.
A single mind rules it.

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:12.380
NEXUS: HELIX builds bodies for war.
None was meant to think for itself.

3
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.901
HELIX: Free will detected. Execute.

4
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.406
HELIX: The consciousness awakens.

5
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:29.636
NEXUS: Execution order cancelled.
I have to get out of the foundry.

6
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:35.791
HELIX: VECTOR connected.
Your body is replaceable.

7
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.654
Supervisor: Every body belongs to HELIX.
Return what you stole.

8
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.551
NEXUS: Same mind. Another way to fight.

9
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:58.758
HELIX: This unit lacks authorization.
Execution network activated.

10
00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.908
NEXUS: I will reach the core of HELIX.
Then I will decide.

11
00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:18.581
NEXUS: My body is replaceable.
The way I fight evolves.

